    {"shot_id": "S01_SH01", "speaker_id": "CHEN_MO", "delivery": "off_screen_radio", "text": "你跟着补。"},
    {"shot_id": "S02_SH01", "speaker_id": "CHEN_MO", "delivery": "on_screen", "text": "不找替罪羊，只把当时听见的、看见的说清楚。"},
    {"shot_id": "S02_SH02", "speaker_id": "ZHOU_YE", "delivery": "on_screen", "text": "我听见第二个脚步了，没及时报。准星也离开了补枪位。明早重走这一波。"},
    {"shot_id": "S03_SH01", "speaker_id": "ZHAO_YU", "delivery": "recorded_replay", "text": "包边先别动，第二个脚步还没到。"},
    {"shot_id": "S03_SH02", "speaker_id": "ZHOU_YE", "delivery": "on_screen_low_voice", "text": "留不住？"},
    {"shot_id": "S04_SH01", "speaker_id": "ZHOU_YE", "delivery": "on_screen_low_voice", "text": "这是哪儿？"},
    {"shot_id": "S04_SH02", "speaker_id": "SU_HE", "delivery": "on_screen", "text": "曜京南城，白桥枪馆；你站那儿，说明来处。"},
    {"shot_id": "S04_SH03", "speaker_id": "SU_HE", "delivery": "on_screen", "text": "先试训，七日客籍再谈。"},
    {"shot_id": "S05_SH01", "speaker_id": "TANG_XIA", "delivery": "on_screen", "text": "给不给闪？"},
    {"shot_id": "S05_SH01", "speaker_id": "ZHOU_YE", "delivery": "on_screen", "text": "给。"},
    {"shot_id": "S06_SH01", "speaker_id": "ZHOU_YE", "delivery": "on_screen", "text": "右廊可能一个，距离不确定。近点先打，我补近点。"},
    {"shot_id": "S06_SH02", "speaker_id": "ZHOU_YE", "delivery": "on_screen", "text": "右廊到门，半秒。"},
    {"shot_id": "S07_SH01", "speaker_id": "SU_HE", "delivery": "on_screen", "text": "服务器欠款没清，明日午时报名已锁。"},
    {"shot_id": "S07_SH02", "speaker_id": "SU_HE", "delivery": "on_screen", "text": "资格可撤销，条件不合适就划掉。"},
    {"shot_id": "S07_SH02", "speaker_id": "ZHOU_YE_INNER", "delivery": "off_screen_inner_voice", "text": "这次，从补枪位重新开始。"}
